---
// Small, visible crisis-resources note shown on articles whose category
// covers topics where a reader could be in acute distress (anxiety,
// depression, trauma, addiction-recovery). Previously this information only
// lived on /disclaimer, which almost nobody reading an article would find.
//
// NOTE on the phone number below: Rescue 1122 is Punjab's official
// emergency response service (confirmed via the Lahore district government
// site) and is accurate for Lahore/Punjab. There isn't yet a specific,
// verified-current Pakistan mental-health/suicide helpline number in this
// component — if The Psychology Square wants to name one (e.g. a specific
// NGO helpline), Sohail or Sehar should confirm the current number directly
// with that organization before it's added, since publishing a wrong crisis
// number is worse than not publishing one.
---
<aside class="crisis-callout" role="note" aria-label="Crisis resources">
  <p class="crisis-callout__title">If you're in crisis</p>
  <p class="crisis-callout__body">
    This article is educational and isn't a substitute for immediate help. If you or someone you know is
    experiencing suicidal thoughts, severe self-harm urges, or any medical emergency, please reach out right away:
  </p>
  <ul class="crisis-callout__list">
    <li>In Lahore or elsewhere in Punjab, Pakistan: call <strong>Rescue 1122</strong> or go to your nearest hospital emergency department.</li>
    <li>Outside Punjab or outside Pakistan: contact your local emergency services or nearest emergency department.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="crisis-callout__footer">See our full <a href="/disclaimer">disclaimer</a> for more on what The Psychology Square can and can't help with.</p>
</aside>

<style>
  .crisis-callout {
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--sage-500);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--paper-50);
  }

  .crisis-callout__title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--sage-500);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .crisis-callout__body {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-900);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .crisis-callout__list {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-900);
  }

  .crisis-callout__list li {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .crisis-callout__footer {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-600);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .crisis-callout__footer a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .crisis-callout__footer a:hover {
    color: var(--gold-500);
  }
</style>
